  "id": "stmt:fda:tukysa:0:0",
  "type": "Statement",
  "description": "The U.S. Food and Drug Administration granted approval to tucatinib in combination with trastuzumab and capecitabine for the treatment of adult patients with advanced unresectable or metastatic HER2-positive breast cancer, including patients with brain metastases, who have received one or more prior anti-HER2-based regimens in the metastatic setting.",
